.TH BEE 1 "September 2026" "bee 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bee \- download and publish the holy scripture
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bee
.RI [ OUTPUT_FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bee
downloads a pinned plain-text copy of the Bee Movie dialogue transcript,
converts employment-related words into stylized text, and writes the result
to a file.
.PP
If no output file is specified, the result is written to
.IR the_holy_scripture.txt .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage information.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the installed version.
.SH AUTHOR
Panagiotis Kouzaris
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/redpanas/bee
